 "intro_zh": "炎帝陵陵区面积约5平方公里，是中华民族始祖炎帝神农氏的寝陵圣地。因其历史悠久，被誉为“神州第一陵”，现为全国重点文物保护单位、全国爱国主义教育示范基地。",
 "intro_en": "The Yandi Mausoleum area covers an area of ​​about 5 square kilometers. It is the holy place where the Yandi Shennong, the ancestor of the Chinese nation, was buried. Because of its long history, it is known as the \"No. 1 Mausoleum in China\". It is now a national key cultural relics protection unit and a national patriotism education demonstration base.",
